[signal arg="spot:none"]
Your Grace, I am your Hand. Three things, and the realm is yours.
- I know the realm
	[end_timeline]
- Show me
[signal arg="do:select"]
This is your host. Click it.
[signal arg="do:march"]
Now right-click open ground. Your host marches there.
[signal arg="spot:chronicle"]
What needs you stands here, the gravest first.
[signal arg="do:answer"]
Here is one. The answer on the right is the one I would give. Choose.
[signal arg="spot:none"]
The realm is yours. The question mark at the bottom right calls me back.
